l says Saito's plan was  clearly premeditated this is something  that was not done by somebody who was a  was suffering from any sort of mental  defect and we intend to press that  argument with the court at least 7  employees at the mental hospital have  been placed on unpaid administrative  leave pending an investigation Saito now  faces a hearing in California to be  extradited back to Hawaii beyond him  yeah those employees have some questions  to answer Vlad thank you
 

